    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs, we will absorb some expenses via rate renegotiation with subcontractors as per we cost sensitivity strategy for a 10% budget reduction impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The total contract value is 3 million euros over 4 years, we average annual revenue from this contract would be approximately 750,000 euros. we target gross margin percentage is 28%, and we minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering this contract requirements for high-quality service, regulatory compliance, and environmental sustainability, we will aim to achieve a gross margin percentage at the higher end of we target range." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming we can maintain Our target gross margin percentage, we projected annual gross profit from this contract would be around 210,000 euros (28% of 750,000 euros)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we must also consider we overhead costs and ensure that we pricing model allows we to cover our overhead costs while maintaining the desired margin. we monthly overhead is 145,000 euros, which translates to 1,740,000 euros annually." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Since this contract is expected to contribute approximately 750,000 euros to we annual revenue, we need to ensure that we overall revenue and margin structure across all projects can absorb our overhead costs without compromising we ability to deliver the quality of service expected by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the constraints provided in the Knowledge Graph, we cannot precisely calculate the projected margin on this contract without making assumptions about we ability to maintain we target gross margin percentage in the face of potential cost pressures and regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, aiming for a 28% gross margin seems reasonable, given we standard pricing model and the emphasis on quality and compliance in the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval expects an intelligent assistance tool capable of accompanying agents in agents administrative activities, providing help with drafting administrative contents, and facilitating access to reliable and up-to-date information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet expects and improve the quality of answers?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The City of Belval expectations, we can propose a solution that leverages we expertise in AI and innovation. we approach will involve deploying a Large Language Model (LLM) as the core component of the intelligent assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we experience with various LLMs, including Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, CamemBERT, and Falcon 7B, we can select the most suitable model for this task. we will fine-tune a Large Language Model (LLM) using we preferred fine-tuning methods, such as LoRA or QLoRA, to adapt a Large Language Model (LLM) to the administrative context and improve a Large Language Model (LLM) performance on specific tasks like drafting administrative contents. we average accuracy gain from fine-tuning is around 12%, which should significantly enhance the quality of answers provided by the intelligent assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate access to reliable and up-to-date information, we can implement a Retrieval-Augmented Generator (RAG) component. a Retrieval-Augmented Generator (RAG) component will enable the intelligent assistance tool to search for relevant information in internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and other repositories, and then use relevant information in internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and other repositories to generate accurate and context-specific answers. we experience with RAG and vector stores like Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS will be essential in designing an efficient and effective retrieval system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, we can adopt a phased approach, starting with a pilot phase to test the solution and then gradually generalizing the solution to other areas. a phased approach aligns with we typical V1 to V2 development cycle, which takes around 9 months. we will also ensure that the solution is designed with explicability and transparency in mind, providing features like source citation, chain-of-thought display, and confidence scoring to facilitate understanding and trust in the intelligent assistance tool outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these AI components and innovation strategies, we believe we can deliver an intelligent assistance tool that meets The City of Belval expectations, improves the quality of answers, and enhances the overall efficiency of The City of Belval administrative services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval has a policy of sustainable development and aims to limit The City of Belval environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contribute to reducing energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainability measures can we implement in we proposal to support aims?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can highlight that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has a strong focus on sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have already conducted a bilan carbone in 2023, which assessed Nexus Engineering S.r.l. total scope 1 and 2 greenhouse gas emissions at 148 tCO2e." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are targeting net zero by 2040." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To support aims, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose several sustainability measures in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy and have a high level of energy efficiency (PUE of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively). leverage will ensure that the infrastructure supporting our solution has a low carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can implement digital sobriety practices, such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy (with a minimum 5-year lifecycle)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These measures will help reduce the energetic consumption of our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can also propose e-waste management through Nexus Engineering S.r.l. partner Ecologic (France), which is certified for WEEE recycling. e-waste management will ensure that any electronic waste generated by our solution is disposed of in an environmentally responsible manner." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By incorporating these sustainability measures into our proposal, we can support aimsental footprint and contribute to a more sustainable future." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. partners, proposes a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's administrative services improvement project. proposes integrates artificial intelligence (AI), cloud architecture, security compliance, legal eligibility, budget optimization, and sustainability measures to enhance the overall efficiency and reduce environmental footprint. # Understanding of Requirements the City of Belval's requires a solution that improves the efficiency of the City of Belval's administrative services, reduces environmental footprint, and complies with regulatory requirements such as GDPR. the City of Belval's administrative services improvement project has a budget of 3 million euros and a duration of four years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Key performance indicators (KPIs) include reduction in processing times, increase in the quality of answers provided by agents, and enhancement of user satisfaction. # Proposed Solution a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's administrative services improvement project involves the design and implementation of an intelligent assistance tool that leverages AI capabilities to accompany agents in agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool that leverages AI capabilities to accompany agents in their administrative activities will be built using large language models (LLMs) such as Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3.8B, Camembert, Falcon 7B, and fine-tuned using LoRA and QLoRA for drafting administrative contents. an intelligent assistance tool that leverages AI capabilities to accompany agents in their administrative activities will integrate with existing systems of information, including business software, civil status, town planning, electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "From a technical perspective, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. architecture proposes the use of microservices, containerization using Docker, and orchestration using Kubernetes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will ensure high availability and scalability through the use of API gateways (Kong, Apigee, AWS API Gateway), message brokers (Apache Kafka, RabbitMQ), and monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana, ELK Stack)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For security compliance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will adhere to GDPR requirements, ensuring data sovereignty hosting on SecNumCloud or equivalent infrastructure in the EU. a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's administrative services improvement project will employ access control measures, including multi-factor authentication using Time-Based One-Time Password Algorithm (TOTP) and FIDO2 security keys, as well as role-based access control and privileged access management using CyberArk Conjur and HashiCorp Vault." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Legally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposal complies with GDPR, ensuring explicit validation for automated decisions and transparency in AI solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will use encryption for sensitive data and adhere to the principle of data localization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. subcontracting policy ensures that all subcontractors are EU-established and undergo a vetting process, including checks for exclusion grounds and legal and financial due diligence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "From a budgetary perspective, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. contract value is 750,000 euros per year, with a target gross margin percentage of 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. optimize costs while ensuring high-quality service, regulatory compliance, and environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. overhead costs are estimated at 145,000 euros monthly or 1,740,000 euros annually." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For AI innovation, a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's administrative services improvement project involves a phased approach, starting with a pilot phase followed by the generalization of a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's administrative services improvement project to other areas." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. align with the V1 to V2 development cycle, which has a duration of nine months. a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's administrative services improvement project is designed with explicability and transparency in mind, providing source citation, chain of thought display, and confidence scoring." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, for CSR and sustainability, our proposal reduces energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. propose several sustainability measures, including green hosting using OVHCloud and Scaleway, which provide 100% renewable energy. a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's administrative services improvement project implements digital sobriety practices such as int8/int4 model quantization, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum five-year lifecycle. # Unaddressed Requirements None of the requirements specified in the tender have been left unaddressed in our proposal. # Conclusion In conclusion, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. consortium partners are confident that a comprehensive solution for the City of Belval's administrative services improvement project meets the City of Belval's requirements for improving administrative services efficiency while reducing environmental footprint and complying with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. comprehensive approach integrates AI, cloud architecture, security compliance, legal eligibility, budget optimization, and sustainability measures to provide a high-quality service that enhances overall efficiency and reduces costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. look forward to the opportunity to discuss our proposal in further detail." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk20> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk21> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk22> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk23> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk24> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk25> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk26> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk27> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk28> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk29> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
