        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk33> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The present contract has for object the design, the implementation and the deployment of such a solution. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk34> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk35> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk36> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk37> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk38> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk39> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk4> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The present contract has for object the design, the implementation and the deployment of such a solution. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk40> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk41> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk42> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk43> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk44> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk45> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk46> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk47> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk48> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk49> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk5> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk53> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk54> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval is looking to implement an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in agents daily missions, with a focus on improving the efficiency of administrative services and reducing environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, with annual exploitation costs that must remain controlled." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key performance indicators (KPIs) we should prioritize for The project to ensure The project success?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., our can identify some relevant KPIs for The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To measure the improvement of administrative services, our could track metrics such as reduction in processing times, increase in the quality of answers provided by agents, and enhancement of user satisfaction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the focus on reducing environmental footprint, another key KPI would be the reduction of energetic consumption, which aligns with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience in green IT solutions through partnerships like GreenCompute S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, to ensure The project financial sustainability, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. should monitor annual exploitation costs and compare annual exploitation costs against the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will help Nexus Engineering S.r.l. stay within the 3 million euros global budget over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, since the solution involves artificial intelligence for agent assistance, we could track metrics related to the adoption rate of the intelligent assistance tool among agents, as well as the intelligent assistance tool effectiveness in facilitating access to reliable and up-to-date information, which aligns with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. capabilities in AI solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By prioritizing some relevant KPIs for this project, we can ensure that The project meets The City of Belval objectives while staying within budget and contributing to environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must integrate with existing systems of information, including business software, civil status, town planning, electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution also requires an API interface and a high level of availability compatible with the needs of municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technical stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do our propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has experience in integration capabilities, including API standards such as REST, GraphQL, SOAP, and CMIS, as well as API gateways like Kong, Apigee, and AWS API Gateway. our also have expertise in message brokers like Apache Kafka and RabbitMQ, which can help facilitate the integration with existing systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current technical stack, I propose a microservices-based architecture that leverages containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) to ensure scalability and high availability. a microservices-based architecture that leverages containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) to ensure scalability and high availability will enable our to integrate with various existing systems through APIs and message brokers, allowing for seamless communication between different components." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the requirement of a high level of availability, our can utilize our experience with monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack to set up a robust monitoring system that ensures the solution's performance and uptime meet the needs of municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For the API interface, our can design a RESTful API that provides a standardized interface for interacting with the existing systems of information. our expertise in cloud architecture, particularly with cloud providers like OVHcloud, Scaleway, Outscale (SecNumCloud), and Azure (EU regions), will also enable our to host the solution on a secure and scalable infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific components, our can use our experience with data engineering to design a data pipeline that integrates with the existing EDM system, and utilize our knowledge of cybersecurity to ensure the solution meets the required security standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our expertise in AI/ML systems can be leveraged to provide intelligent assistance tools that interact with the integrated systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our current technical stack provides a solid foundation for meeting the requirements outlined, and I am confident that our can design an architecture that integrates effectively with existing systems of information while providing high availability and scalability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval requires that the solution complies with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensures data sovereignty by hosting on SecNumCloud or equivalent infrastructure within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security measures should we implement to guarantee compliance and protect sensitive data?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensure data sovereignty, we can implement several security measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a company, we have experience with regulatory frameworks such as RGPD/GDPR and have appointed a Data Protection Officer (DPO) whose contact is dpo@nexus-engineering.it.  we are also ISO 27001 certified, which demonstrates we commitment to information security management systems. we scope of certification includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, we can implement measures such as encryption and anonymization if necessary. we have experience with anonymisation tools like Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we access control standards include multi-factor authentication (MFA) enforced with methods like TOTP and hardware tokens (FIDO2), role-based access control (RBAC) design experience, and privileged access management (PAM) solutions such as CyberArk Conjur and HashiCorp Vault. we also have a strong network security architecture based on patterns like Zero-trust, micro-segmentation, and defence-in-depth. we incident response capabilities include a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) in place, breach notification delay hours set to 72, and playbooks available for drills that occur semi-annually." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For hosting, we can ensure that data is hosted within the the EU territory as required, leveraging we experience with SecNumCloud projects. we have worked on three SecNumCloud projects previously, demonstrating we capability to meet specific security requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these measures, we can help ensure compliance with regulatory requirements and protect sensitive data in accordance with The City of Belval needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict compliance with GDPR, ensuring no data transfer outside the EU, encryption of sensitive data, and explicit validation by an agent for any automated decision." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with GDPR and have a standard legal basis for processing personal data under Article 6(1)(e) - performance of task in public interest. we DPA template version is v3.2, and we have support available for Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs).  we do not transfer data outside the EU, which aligns with the requirement to keep data within the the EU territory." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we default IP model is work-for-hire, where all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment, ensuring that the client retains ownership of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding encryption and protection of sensitive data, we have a policy in place for protecting client data, stating that all client data remains the sole property of the contracting authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, specific details on we encryption methods are not provided in our company context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For automated decision-making, we have a no-automated-decision-without-human-validation policy in place, which aligns with the requirement for explicit validation by an agent for any automated decision." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for potential legal risks, one area to monitor is ensuring that we subcontractors, if any are involved, comply with the same GDPR requirements. we subcontracting policy requires all subcontractors to be the EU-established and undergo a vetting process, including checks for exclusion grounds and legal and financial due diligence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another risk could be related to cross-border data flow within the EU, although since we only operate within the EU, Another risk is less of a concern. we should also ensure that we AI solutions are designed with explicability and transparency in mind, which aligns with we eu_ai_act_expertise and awareness of prohibited AI practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, based on our company context, we appear to be generally compliant with the GDPR requirements specified in The tender, including data localization, encryption, and explicit validation for automated decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it's crucial to ensure that any subcontractors adhere to the GDPR requirements specified in the tender, including data localization, encryption, and explicit validation for automated decisions as well and that we maintain transparency and explicability in our AI solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The total contract value is 3 million euros over 4 years, with annual exploitation costs that must be compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we optimize we costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected, and what is we projected margin on this contract?" ;
